# Fixfly Innovations Netlify Proxy & Routing Rules

# 1. Static API mock endpoints (allows Netlify static deployment to serve data without server errors)
/api/services           /data/services.json           200
/api/software           /data/software_products.json  200
/api/rates              /data/rates.json              200
/api/experts            /data/experts.json            200
/api/amazon-products    /data/amazon_products.json    200
/api/all-reviews        /data/service_reviews.json    200
/api/orders             /data/orders.json             200

# 2. Direct route for Admin Portal
/admin                  /admin.html                   200
/admin/*                /admin.html                   200

# 3. Direct route for Zip Download & Downloads Page
/download               /download.html                200
/download-zip           /fixfly-netlify-ready.zip     200

# 4. Client-side SPA routing fallback for all 51+ blog articles and pages
/*                      /index.html                   200
